    },
    {
      "displayText": "你问我在干什么？\n我在喂野生的可可多拉吃饭。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6095EE621157285E724EC04E48FF1F000A62115728558291CE751F768453EF53EF591A62C95403996D3002001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可可多拉爱吃铁，但是放任不管的话，\n它会连车之类的都吃掉哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF53EF591A62C97231540394C1FF0C4F46662F653E4EFB4E0D7BA176848BDDFF0C000A5B834F1A8FDE8F664E4B7C7B768490FD5403638954E63002001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了不让它们乱吃东西，\n我才像这样喂它们吃铁屑的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E864E0D8BA95B834EEC4E7154034E1C897FFF0C000A6211624D50CF8FD9683755825B834EEC540394C15C5176843002001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但总吃铁屑可可多拉们也会腻的，\n我好担心啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46603B540394C15C5153EF53EF591A62C94EEC4E5F4F1A817B7684FF0C000A6211597D62C55FC3554A3002001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "于是我想到了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E8E662F621160F352304E8620262026001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用毒属性的招式帮铁屑调味，\n应该会不错吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75286BD25C5E6027768462DB5F0F5E2E94C15C518C035473FF0C000A5E948BE54F1A4E0D95195427FF01001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对钢属性的宝可梦来说，\n毒什么的根本不在话下。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF994A25C5E602776845B9D53EF68A667658BF4FF0C000A6BD24EC04E4876846839672C4E0D57288BDD4E0B3002001000020114014D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你试试对铁屑使出\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>污泥炸弹<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>这招来调味吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕō",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
